</span>
<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span><span id="id23" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_institution">Huawei Canada</span>, <span id="id24" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_city">Kingston</span>, <span id="id25" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_state">ON</span>, <span id="id26" class="ltx_text ltx_affiliation_country">Canada</span>
